msgid "OptiScaler takes over the game's XeSS — verified with Shadow of the Tomb Raider on an AMD RDNA 4 card and a GeForce GTX 1050 Ti"
msgstr "O OptiScaler substitui o XeSS do jogo — verificado com Shadow of the Tomb Raider numa placa AMD RDNA 4 e numa GeForce GTX 1050 Ti"

